Dear {!$Record.EYI_REC__r.EYI_First_Name__c} {!$Record.EYI_REC__r.EYI_Last_Name__c},
Thank you for reaching out to us. Your case has been successfully created. Here are the details:
- Case Number: {!$Record.CaseNumber}
- Subject: {!$Record.Subject}
- Description: {!$Record.Description}
- Business Support no: 8069222558
We will get back to you shortly.

Regards,
Panchshil Reality

Dear Sir/Ma'am,
Following case is not resolved. 
Case Number: {!$Record.CaseNumber}
Opportunity: {!$Record.EYI_Opportunity__r.EYI_Opportunity_Name__c}

Dear {!Get_owner_name.Name},
This is to notify you that the complaint #{!$Record.CaseNumber}, titled "{!$Record.Subject}", has been reopened by the REC. It has been reassigned to you as you were the original handler of this complaint.
Complaint Details:
Complaint Number: #{!$Record.CaseNumber}
Reopened Date: {!$Record.LastModifiedDate}
Customer Name: {!$Record.EYI_REC__r.EYI_First_Name__c} {!$Record.EYI_REC__r.EYI_Last_Name__c}
Complaint Subject: {!$Record.Subject}
Previous Closure Date: {!$Record__Prior.ClosedDate}
Next Steps:
Please review the case and take the necessary actions to address the customer’s concerns. If additional details are required, you may contact the customer directly or coordinate with the support team.

Dear Finance Team,
A cancellation case has been initiated with the following details: Case ID: {!$Record.CaseNumber} Opportunity: {!$Record.EYI_Opportunity__r.EYI_Opportunity_Name__c} - ({!$Record.EYI_Opportunity__r.EYI_Opportunity_Number__c}) Remark for Finance: {!$Record.EYI_Remark_For_Finance__c}
Thank you, Panchshil Team

Hi {!Get_Opp.Owner.Name},
This case is assigned to you. Please check the
Case No : {!$Record.SuppliedName}
Remarks: {!$Record.EYI_Remarks__c}

Thanks & Regards
Panchshil
